```java
private static void awaitCount(Capture cap, int expected, long timeoutSeconds) throws InterruptedException {
    long deadline = System.nanoTime() + TimeUnit.SECONDS.toNanos(timeoutSeconds);
    while (cap.count() < expected && System.nanoTime() < deadline) {
        Thread.sleep(50);
    }
}
```

